        {
          "locator": "Gated Linear Units (GLU) and Variants, equation (5)",
          "text": "\\textrm{SwiGLU}(x,W,V,b,c,\\beta)&=\\textrm{Swish}_{\\beta}(xW+b)\\otimes(xV+c)\\\\"
        },
        {
          "locator": "Gated Linear Units (GLU) and Variants, equation (6)",
          "text": "\\textrm{FFN}_{\\textrm{SwiGLU}}(x,W,V,W_{2})&=(\\textrm{Swish}_{1}(xW)\\otimes xV)W_{2}\\\\"
        },
        {
          "locator": "Gated Linear Units (GLU) and Variants, text following equation (6)",
          "text": "All of these layers have three weight matrices, as opposed to two for the original FFN."
        }
      ],
      "inspection_note": "已讀原文 Introduction、Gated Linear Units (GLU) and Variants、Model Architecture 與比較條件。Swish_beta(x)=x*sigmoid(beta*x)，FFN_SwiGLU 用 beta=1；兩個輸入投影逐項相乘後乘第三張表。原文實驗省略 bias，hidden 由 3072 改成 2048，以 2/3 匹配權重與主要矩陣運算量。此處保存公式與短摘錄；不保存第三方全文。"
    },
