        {
          "locator": "SiLU docstring",
          "text": "The SiLU function is also known as the swish function."
        },
        {
          "locator": "SiLU docstring, defining equation",
          "text": "\\text{silu}(x) = x * \\sigma(x), \\text{where } \\sigma(x) \\text{ is the logistic sigmoid.}"
        },
        {
          "locator": "Sigmoid docstring, defining equation",
          "text": "\\text{Sigmoid}(x) = \\sigma(x) = \\frac{1}{1 + \\exp(-x)}"
        }
      ],
      "inspection_note": "已核對與本機 torch.version.git_version 完全相同的官方原始碼：Sigmoid、SiLU 的公式，SiLU.forward 呼叫 F.silu，及 SiLU 的逐項、保留形狀契約。"
